## 🎯 Daily Challenge

Given the schedule:

```text
R1(A)
W1(A)
R2(A)
W2(A)
R1(B)
W1(B)
```

1. Draw the **precedence graph**.
2. Is the schedule **conflict serializable**?
3. If yes, write the equivalent **serial schedule**.
4. Is the schedule also **view serializable**? Explain why.

